<h3>Open Trailers</h3>
<p>While open trailers offer lower costs, they come with several disadvantages:</p>

<p><strong>Lack of Protection:</strong> Open trailers expose your car to external elements, including:</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Road Debris:</strong> Your car may experience scratches, dents or other minor damages from flying objects on the road.</span></li>
